{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Mechanism verified by experiment at the seam (not from code reading alone), one layer below the suspected fault:\n\n* LAYER BELOW - forcing `subprocess.run` inside `rebar._snapshot.repo_snapshot` to raise `TimeoutExpired` made `_fetch_origin(repo, remote=\"origin\", blobless=False)` raise `SnapshotFetchError: git fetch from 'origin' timed out after 300s (attested mode fails closed)`. The timeout->SnapshotFetchError conversion at repo_snapshot.py:376-380 is real.\n* ADAPTER - raising that `SnapshotFetchError` out of `produce_code_review_verdict` returned `decision=BLOCK, coverage_gap=True, message=\"[LLM-Review: BLOCK - coverage-gap (review-error)]\"`.\n* VOTER - `review_and_vote` on that decision returned `status=\"voted\"` and POSTed `-1` to the fake Gerrit, and wrote the dedup row.\n* RECONCILE - reconcile_once pre-filters on `store.already_voted` and `gc.has_llm_review_vote` (reconcile.py:205-211), so the change is skipped forever once the -1 exists.\n\nFix landed test-first. RED (fix reverted, new tests kept): 7 failed / 68 passed. GREEN (fix restored): 75 passed / 6 skipped in tests/unit/test_review_bot.py.\n\nChanged: adapter.py adds `_is_retryable_infra` (SnapshotFetchError, subprocess.TimeoutExpired, TimeoutError, ConnectionError; bounded __cause__ walk) and an ABSTAIN result; voter.py returns `{\"status\":\"abstained\",\"stage\":\"review_infra\"}` with a VOTER_ERROR marker, no vote and no dedup row. reconcile.py unchanged - it only counts `status==\"voted\"`, and a vote-less change is re-picked next pass.\n\nAC5 (git http.lowSpeedLimit/lowSpeedTime on the review bot so the stall aborts in seconds) is deliberately NOT in this change; filed separately."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785706664008853001,"uuid":"74cd93eb-8336-41b6-a530-e91384fd42a3"}